---
import Container from '../common/Container.astro';
import WhatsAppButton from '../common/WhatsAppButton.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<section id="final-cta" class="py-16 lg:py-24">
  <Container>
    <div class="reveal rounded-card-lg bg-primary text-white p-8 lg:p-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-[2.5rem] font-extrabold leading-tight text-balance">Siap Pesan OHMEGA?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base lg:text-lg text-soft-green max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Pilih kemasan yang sesuai dan dapatkan layanan antar langsung ke rumah.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <WhatsAppButton source="final_cta" size="lg" label="Pesan melalui WhatsApp" />
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-soft-green/90">
        Gratis antar di area terpilih. Pengiriman ke area {site.serviceArea} lainnya dikonfirmasi melalui WhatsApp.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
